N
Game over", "")
        Paragraph("Debug your program and fix any compiler errors there might be. Now would be a great time to use the debugger to test your program. When an action is called use 'step into' to see what happens when a particular action is called. Did your program run correctly? If not, fix any problems. Show the work to the instructor.")
    end
end
